<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= board.title %> - 중고마켓 동네생활</title>

    <link href="/krds/css/token/krds_tokens.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="/krds/css/common/common.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="/krds/css/component/component.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script defer src="/krds/js/component/ui-script.js"></script>

    <style>
        body { background-color: #ffffff; } 
        #krds-footer { background-color: #f4f6f9; margin-top: 80px; padding: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        
        .krds-main-menu .gnb-menu > li > .gnb-main-trigger::after { display: none !important; }
        .btn-logout-fix::before, .btn-logout-fix::after { display: none !important; }
        .btn-logout-fix { display: inline-flex !important; flex-direction: row !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 4px !important; width: auto !important; white-space: nowrap !important; }
        .btn-logout-fix svg { display: block !important; margin: 0 !important; }
        
        .header-branding { display: flex; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
        .header-branding .logo, .header-branding .logo a { background: none !important; background-image: none !important; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; }

        .subpage-container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 0 20px; min-height: 50vh; }

        .cl_type { width: 100%; }
        .default_order { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #ced4da; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 40px; overflow: hidden; }
        .order_item { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; font-size: 1.6rem; color: #868e96; font-weight: 500; position: relative; }
        .order_item.on { background: #246beb; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
        .order_item em { font-style: normal; display: inline-block; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-right: 5px; opacity: 0.8; }
        .order_item:not(:last-child)::after { content: ''; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 20%; height: 60%; width: 1px; background: #ced4da; }
        .order_item.on::after { display: none; }

        .titBox { margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .titBox h4 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #111; }

        .answerWrap { border-top: 2px solid #222; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .h_InputType dl { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef; margin: 0; }
        .h_InputType dt { width: 150px; background: #f8f9fa; padding: 18px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; font-size: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; border-right: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        .h_InputType dd { flex: 1; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #495057; display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .h_InputType dd p { white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; font-size: 1.6rem; color: #222; }

        .comment-wrap { border-top: 2px solid #222; padding-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .comment-tit { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #111; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .comment-list { margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; }
        .comment-item { border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; padding: 20px 10px; }
        .comment-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #666; }
        .comment-info strong { color: #246beb; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .comment-text { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #333; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.6; }
        
        .comment-form { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ced4da; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
        .comment-form textarea { width: 100%; height: 80px; padding: 15px; font-size: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #ced4da; border-radius: 4px; resize: vertical; outline: none; }
        .comment-form textarea:focus { border-color: #246beb; }
        .comment-form .btn-submit-comment { align-self: flex-end; background: #495057; color: #fff; padding: 10px 30px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .comment-form .btn-submit-comment:hover { background: #343a40; }

        /* 하단 버튼 (btnAreaLR) */
        .btnAreaLR { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; margin-top: 30px; }
        .btnAreaLR .btn { padding: 14px 40px; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; border: none; }
        .btnAreaLR .btn.fill { background: #246beb; color: #fff; transition: 0.2s; }
        .btnAreaLR .btn.fill:hover { background: #1d56bc; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap" class="g-wrap">

    <header id="krds-header">
        <div class="header-in">
            <div class="header-container">
                <div class="inner">
                    <div class="header-branding">
                        <h1 class="logo">
                            <a href="/" style="display: block;">
                                <img src="/sitelogo.png" alt="사이트 로고" style="height: 45px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;">
                            </a>
                        </h1>

                        <div class="header-actions" style="margin-left: auto;">
                            <% if (user) { %>
                                <span class="btn-navi my" style="background:none; cursor:default;">
                                    <strong><%= user.username %></strong>님
                                </span>
                                <a href="/logout" class="btn-navi btn-logout-fix" style="text-decoration: none; color: #333;">
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-top:-2px;">
                                        <path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"></path>
                                        <polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"></polyline>
                                        <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"></line>
                                    </svg>
                                    <span>로그아웃</span>
                                </a>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/login" class="btn-navi login">로그인</a>
                                <a href="/signup" class="btn-navi join">회원가입</a>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <nav class="krds-main-menu">
                <div class="inner">
                    <ul class="gnb-menu" aria-label="메인 메뉴">
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/info'">서비스 안내</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/board'">게시판</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/friends'">친구 관리</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/items'">판매 물품 정보</button></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div id="container" class="subpage-container">
        
        <div id="div_frmDsgnType" class="cl_type">
            <div class="default_order col_2">
                <div class="order_item icon_1">
                    <span><em>1단계</em> 게시글 작성</span>
                </div>
                <div class="order_item icon_3 on">
                    <span><em>2단계</em> 작성 완료</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="titBox type_1 icon icon_1">
                <h4>게시글 내용</h4>
            </div>
    
            <div class="answerWrap">
                <div class="answerBox">
                    <div class="h_InputType">
                        <dl>
                            <dt>제목</dt>
                            <dd><strong><%= board.title %></strong></dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>작성자</dt>
                            <dd><%= board.author %></dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>작성일시</dt>
                            <dd><%= board.createdAt.toLocaleString() %></dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>조회수</dt>
                            <dd><%= board.views %></dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt style="align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 20px;">내용</dt>
                            <dd style="align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px;">
                                <p><%= board.content %></p>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="comment-wrap">
                <h4 class="comment-tit">댓글 (<%= board.comments ? board.comments.length : 0 %>)</h4>
                
                <div class="comment-list">
                    <% if (board.comments && board.comments.length > 0) { %>
                        <% board.comments.forEach(function(comment) { %>
                            <div class="comment-item">
                                <div class="comment-info">
                                    <strong><%= comment.author %></strong>
                                    <span><%= comment.createdAt.toLocaleString() %></span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="comment-text"><%= comment.content %></div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div style="padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #888; font-size: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;">
                            등록된 댓글이 없습니다. 첫 댓글을 남겨보세요!
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                </div>

                <% if (user) { %>
                    <form action="/board/<%= board._id %>/comment" method="POST" class="comment-form">
                        <textarea name="commentContent" placeholder="이웃을 존중하는 따뜻한 댓글을 남겨주세요." required></textarea>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit-comment">댓글 등록</button>
                    </form>
                <% } else { %>
                    <div class="comment-form" style="align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 30px;">
                        <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 10px;">댓글을 작성하려면 로그인이 필요합니다.</p>
                        <a href="/login" class="btn fill" style="background: #246beb; color: white; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">로그인 하기</a>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </div>
            <div class="btnAreaLR">
                <div class="btnA_r">
                    <a href="/board" class="btn fill">목록</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

    <footer id="krds-footer">
        <div class="inner">
            <div class="f-btm">
                <div class="f-btm-text">
                    <div class="f-menu">
                        <a href="/terms" class="krds-btn small text">이용 안내</a>
                        <a href="/privacy" class="krds-btn small text">개인정보처리방침</a>
                        <a href="/copyright" class="krds-btn small text">저작권 정책</a>
                    </div>
                    <p class="f-copy">© 2026 Korea National University of Transportation. All rights reserved.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>